<title>WEST INDIES: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BOWLED OUT FOR 147.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BOWLED OUT FOR 147.</headline>
<text>
<p>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent, June 20, Reuter - West Indies were bowled out for 147 on the opening day of the second test against Sri Lanka on Friday.</p>
<p>Score: West Indies 147 (C. Hooper 81, R. Pushpakumara 5-41).</p>
